#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1048
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a free silenced pistol."
msgstr "에게 소음 권총을 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1052
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Silenced Pistol for 3 food"
msgstr "소음 권총 - 식량 3"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1055
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Sniper Rifle for 25 food"
msgstr "저격 소총 - 식량 25"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1058
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Quiet Shotgun for 30 food"
msgstr "조용한 산탄총 - 식량 30"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1070
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a TactiCop Lite(TM)!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 택티캅 라이트(TM)를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1071
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "The king of flashlights! Also good for thunking zombie skulls!"
msgstr "손전등의 왕! 좀비 머리통을 후려치기에도 좋지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1076
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a can of Healing Spray!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 치료 스프레이 한 통을 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1077
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Spray someone to heal them. You can spray yourself by walking into the "
"healing cloud! In emergencies, you can also melt zombies with it."
msgstr "사람에게 뿌리면 치료돼. 분무 구름 속으로 걸어가면 자신도 치료할 수 있지! 급할 땐 좀비를 녹이는 데 써도 돼."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1082
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a flashlight."
msgstr "은(는) 손전등을 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1084
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I have a zillion of these, if you happen to need hundreds of flashlights."
msgstr "이거 엄청 많아. 손전등 수백 개가 필요하다면 말이지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1093
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Handy Survival Tools"
msgstr "편리한 생존 도구"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1094
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"This trader is waving a sturdy military flashlight around. It's an old business trick to draw in customers.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"상인이 튼튼한 군용 손전등을 흔들고 있다. 손님을 끌어모으는 오래된 장사 수법이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1095
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "It pays to be prepared!"
msgstr "준비해 두면 이득이지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1103
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1154
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "You're out of food! The trader gives "
msgstr "식량이 다 떨어졌다! 상인은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a free flashlight."
msgstr "에게 손전등을 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Healing Spray for 6 food"
msgstr "치료 스프레이 - 식량 6"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "TactiCop Lite for 5 food"
msgstr "택티캅 라이트 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Flashlight for 1 food"
msgstr "손전등 - 식량 1"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys 8 land mines."
msgstr "은(는) 지뢰 8개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"Set a trap for the zombies with these, then let the explosions do all the "
"work!"
msgstr "이걸로 좀비에게 함정을 놓고, 나머지는 폭발에 맡겨!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a grenade launcher with 6 shots!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 유탄 6발이 든 유탄 발사기를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"You can safely fire this right into a crowd of zombies! The grenades explode"
" after one second."
msgstr "좀비 무리 한가운데에 쏴도 안전해! 유탄은 1초 뒤에 폭발하거든."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a bazooka and three rockets!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 바주카와 로켓 3발을 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "This is THE tool for blowing up a crowd of zombies, fast."
msgstr "좀비 무리를 순식간에 날려 버리는 데 이만한 도구가 없지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys 2 land mines."
msgstr "은(는) 지뢰 2개를 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Drop one on the ground, then run and wait for the explosion!"
msgstr "땅에 하나 놓고 달아나서 폭발을 기다려!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Heavy Ordinance"
msgstr "중화기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1151
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" meets a man holding a bazooka and a satchel overstuffed with beeping mines. He looks so happy with his explosives.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 바주카를 들고 삑삑거리는 지뢰로 가방을 꽉 채운 남자를 만난다. 폭발물 때문에 정말 행복해 보인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1152
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"These weapons will not let you down! Unless, of course, you blow yourself up"
" with them."
msgstr "이 무기들은 널 실망시키지 않을 거야! 물론, 네가 스스로를 날려 버리면 얘기가 다르지만."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a complimentary land mine."
msgstr "에게 지뢰 하나를 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "8 Land Mines for 20 food"
msgstr "지뢰 8개 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Bazooka - 3 shots - 12 food"
msgstr "바주카 - 3발 - 식량 12"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Grenade Launcher - 6 shots - 12 food"
msgstr "유탄 발사기 - 6발 - 식량 12"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "2 Land Mines for 6 food"
msgstr "지뢰 2개 - 식량 6"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a fire whip! Embers bounce gently off its glowing tail end."
msgstr "은(는) 불 채찍을 산다! 빛나는 끝에서 불씨가 살랑살랑 튄다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I stole this from some guy who was running a circus.\r\n"
"\t\tJust don't hit yourself with it! Best used on groups of enemies.\r\n"
"\t\tIt's quite lightweight, so maybe give it to your athletically challenged characters."
msgstr ""
"서커스 운영하던 어떤 놈한테서 훔쳤어.\r\n"
"\t\t자기 몸만 때리지 마! 적이 몰려 있을 때 제격이지.\r\n"
"\t\t꽤 가벼우니까 운동 능력이 좀 부족한 친구한테 줘도 좋아."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a KO Boomer! Formerly illegal in nearly all countries!"
msgstr "은(는) KO 부머를 산다! 한때 거의 모든 나라에서 불법이었다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"I hear this is still really illegal in Canada!\r\n"
"\t\t25% chance to blow yourself up! Try your luck!\r\n"
"\t\tIf it's feeling hot in your hand, try dropping it and running away REAL fast!"
msgstr ""
"캐나다에선 아직도 엄청 불법이라더라!\r\n"
"\t\t25% 확률로 너까지 터져! 운을 시험해 봐!\r\n"
"\t\t손에서 뜨거워지면 내려놓고 진짜 빨리 달아나!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" buys a Roman Candle!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 로만 캔들을 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "It's so pretty! Zombies love it!"
msgstr "정말 예뻐! 좀비도 좋아해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys a two-pack of Mount Dingus"
msgstr "은(는) 마운트 딩거스 2개 묶음을 산다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1202
#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "[TM]"
msgstr "[TM]"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"!\r\n"
"\tTHE most disappointing firework on the market.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"!\r\n"
"\t시중에서 가장 실망스러운 불꽃놀이 용품이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"It doesn't even explode! It just sprays little sparks!\r\n"
"\tI hate it!"
msgstr ""
"터지지도 않아! 작은 불꽃만 뿜지!\r\n"
"\t난 이거 싫어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " buys 3 bundles of firecrackers."
msgstr "은(는) 폭죽 3묶음을 산다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Light a bundle, then watch the zombies chase it around!"
msgstr "한 묶음에 불을 붙이고 좀비들이 쫓아다니는 걸 구경해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Fireworks Enthusiast"
msgstr "불꽃놀이 애호가"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
" meets a woman holding a roman candle. It's unlit. She seems like she's "
"ready to light it at "
msgstr "은(는) 아직 불붙이지 않은 로만 캔들을 든 여자를 만난다. 불을 붙일 준비가 된 듯하다. 바로 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid ""
"ANY MOMENT.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"지금 당장이라도.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "So strong! So pretty! So practical!"
msgstr "강력하고! 예쁘고! 실용적이야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "I won't be liable if you blow yourself up with the KO Boomer!"
msgstr "KO 부머로 네가 터져도 난 책임 안 져!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " a complimentary bundle of firecrackers."
msgstr "에게 폭죽 한 묶음을 공짜로 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Fire Whip - 20 food"
msgstr "불 채찍 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "KO Boomer - 5 food"
msgstr "KO 부머 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1234
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "Roman Candle - 3 food"
msgstr "로만 캔들 - 식량 3"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "2 Mount Dingus"
msgstr "마운트 딩거스 2개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid " - 3 food"
msgstr " - 식량 3"

#: deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df:1240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/weapons.df"
msgid "3 Firecrackers - 2 food"
msgstr "폭죽 3묶음 - 식량 2"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " tells "
msgstr "은(는) 이렇게 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " to "
msgstr "에게 "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "COOL IT!"
msgstr "진정해!"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " is infuriated by this! "
msgstr "은(는) 이 말에 격분한다! "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " gets "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "SUPER STEAMING MAD!"
msgstr "분노가 활활 타오른다!!"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "I'm not sure if telling someone to "
msgstr "누군가에게 "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "'COOL IT'"
msgstr "'진정해'"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " has ever worked, in the history of the whole world."
msgstr "라고 해서 통했던 적이 인류 역사에 있기는 할까."

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " tries to lay on the charm and get "
msgstr "은(는) 매력을 발휘해서 설득해 본다. "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid ""
" to help fight the zombies swarming in.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"에게 몰려드는 좀비와 함께 싸우자고 부탁한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " sweats visibly."
msgstr "은(는) 눈에 띄게 땀을 흘린다."

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "I'm busy! I'm busy doing stuff! You go do it!"
msgstr "나 바빠! 할 일이 많다고! 네가 해!"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid ""
"Well, it was worth a try. This might have worked on someone that was less of"
" a jerk."
msgstr "시도할 가치는 있었다. 조금 덜 재수 없는 사람이었다면 통했을지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " calls "
msgstr "은(는) 대놓고 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " a "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "dink."
msgstr "재수 없는 놈이다."

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " is shocked! It was fun to finally tell "
msgstr "은(는) 충격을 받는다! 마침내 "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " what a dink "
msgstr "에게, "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " was."
msgstr "는 정말 재수 없는 놈이라고 말하니 속이 시원하다."

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " sees "
msgstr "은(는) 이 사람을 본다. "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid ""
", who is a real dink.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 정말 재수 없는 놈이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies have broken into my home! This is probably your fault! It certainly "
"isn't mine!"
msgstr "좀비가 내 집에 쳐들어왔어! 아마 네 탓일 거야! 절대 내 탓은 아니라고!"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tWhen the group found this zombie bunker, "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t일행이 이 좀비 방공호를 발견했을 때, "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " called dibs on this big bedroom before anyone else."
msgstr "은(는) 누구보다 먼저 이 큰 침실을 찜했다."

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " be for now"
msgstr "를 일단 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "Tell "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " to 'Cool It'"
msgstr "에게 '진정해'라고 하기"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "Convince "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " to help fight zombies"
msgstr "에게 좀비와 싸우자고 설득하기"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid "Call "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " a dink"
msgstr "에게 재수 없는 놈이라고 하기"

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid " greets "
msgstr "은(는) 인사를 건넨다. 상대는 "

#: deathforth/events/tutorial.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/tutorial.df"
msgid ""
"I think we will have to leave this safehouse. At least we got to rest for awhile.\r\n"
"\tWe should try heading to Canada! Would you like me to travel with you?"
msgstr ""
"이 은신처를 떠나야 할 것 같아. 그래도 잠깐 쉬었잖아.\r\n"
