msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "I HEARD HUMANS WERE OBSESSED WITH TOILETS"
msgstr "인간은 변기에 집착한다더라!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Unomey gives you a look of pure disgust.\r\n"
"\tUpgrades toilets. Now they'll have 2 gas instead of 1. Maybe it adds up?"
msgstr ""
"우노미가 완전히 질렸다는 표정으로 바라본다.\r\n"
"\t변기가 강화된다. 이제 기름이 1 대신 2만큼 들어 있다. 모으면 꽤 되려나?"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "ENVIRONMENTAL STORYTELLING"
msgstr "환경을 통한 이야기 전달"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Toilets may now have 2 bullets!\r\n"
"\tFamous game designer Ken Levine calls this "
msgstr ""
"이제 변기에 총알 2발이 있을 수 있다!\r\n"
"\t유명 게임 디자이너 켄 레빈은 이를 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "environmental storytelling"
msgstr "환경을 통한 이야기 전달"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
".\r\n"
"\tEvery toilet with bullets in it tells a story."
msgstr ""
"이라 부른다.\r\n"
"\t총알이 들어 있는 모든 변기에는 이야기가 담겨 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "WOW LOOK AT YOU GO WITH THE TOILET UPGRADES"
msgstr "와, 변기 강화에 진심이네!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Unomey scrunches up his nose in an even more exaggerated look of disgust.\r\n"
"\tToilets can contain 2 bullets. Every little bit helps."
msgstr ""
"우노미가 코를 찡그리며 더욱 노골적으로 질린 표정을 짓는다.\r\n"
"\t변기에 총알 2발이 들어 있을 수 있다. 티끌 모아 태산이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:191
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "TOILET SKELETONS"
msgstr "변기 해골"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Toilets may now have rare and mysterious toilet loot!\r\n"
"\tThis may include skeletons, which elevates the quality of "
msgstr ""
"이제 변기에서 희귀하고 신비한 물자가 나올 수 있다!\r\n"
"\t해골이 나올 수도 있다. 덕분에 완성도가 높아진다. 바로 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Toilet-Based Environmental Storytelling"
msgstr "변기를 통한 환경적 이야기 전달"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
" even further.\r\n"
"\tToilets will also now have a higher loot chance!"
msgstr ""
"의 완성도가.\r\n"
"\t변기에서 물자를 찾을 확률도 높아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "DISGUSTING"
msgstr "역겨워"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Unomey just has a look of blank contempt towards you at this point.\r\n"
"\tToilets may rarely contain something mysterious. Toilets also will get a 30% chance to contain toilet loot, up from the default 20%"
msgstr ""
"이쯤 되자 우노미는 무표정한 경멸의 눈빛으로 바라볼 뿐이다.\r\n"
"\t변기에서 가끔 신비한 물건이 나온다. 변기에 물자가 있을 확률도 기본 20%에서 30%로 높아진다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "HEAVEN'S TOILET: THE ULTIMATE TOILET"
msgstr "천국의 변기: 궁극의 변기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Toilets have ascended to their final form!"
msgstr "변기가 최종 형태로 진화했다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Toilet Genies now occur every 50 opened toilets!\r\n"
"\tDeath Road to Canada represents the ULTIMATE in "
msgstr ""
"이제 변기를 50개 열 때마다 변기 지니가 나타난다!\r\n"
"\t데스 로드 투 캐나다가 선보이는 궁극의 경지! "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Toilet-Based Interactive Fiction!"
msgstr "변기 기반 상호작용 소설!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid " Enjoy!"
msgstr " 즐겨 보자!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"SO DO HUMANS WORSHIP THE TOILETS OR WHAT\r\n"
"\tIS OPENING THEM A RITUAL?\r\n"
"\tWHAT IS WRONG WITH YOU"
msgstr ""
"인간은 변기를 숭배하는 거야 뭐야!!\r\n"
"\t여는 게 의식이야?\r\n"
"\t대체 왜 그러는 거야!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:212
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"With this final toilet upgrade, you only need to open 50 toilets to summon the Toilet Genie, instead of 100!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"마지막 변기 강화를 하면 변기 지니를 부르는 데 필요한 변기 수가 100개에서 50개로 줄어든다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid " I'm being serious."
msgstr " 진지하게 하는 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "TNOMEY THE TRADE GNOME UNLOCKED"
msgstr "상인 노움 트노미 해금"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Unlock 20 Zombo Point options by upgrading him!"
msgstr "강화하면 20 좀보 포인트 상품이 해금된다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"MY PAL TNOMEY WILL GIVE YOU A GOOD DEAL\r\n"
"\tHE'LL START LOITERING AROUND TRADER CAMPS!"
msgstr ""
"내 친구 트노미가 잘해 줄 거야!!\r\n"
"\t이제 상인 야영지에서 어슬렁거릴 거야!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Lets you buy a little bit of extra supplies from Tnomey, the Trade Gnome. He"
" takes ZP as currency, and you may buy one thing from him per game. Besides "
"supplies, he may also sell an extra recruit!"
msgstr ""
"상인 노움 트노미에게 추가 물자를 조금 살 수 있다. ZP로 거래하며 게임마다 한 번 구매할 수 있다. 물자 대신 추가 동료를 팔기도 "
"한다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "TNOMEY THE TRADE GNOME UPGRADED"
msgstr "상인 노움 트노미 강화"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Unlock a 30 ZP tier of items in his final upgrade!"
msgstr "마지막 강화로 30 ZP 상품을 해금하자!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:233
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"HOW DOES HE SELL THESE RODENTS?\r\n"
"\tHE HAS THEM ALL STUFFED INTO A SACK"
msgstr ""
"저 설치류를 어떻게 파는 걸까?\r\n"
"\t전부 자루에 쑤셔 넣어 놨네!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"This will upgrade the Trade Gnome to carry items worth 20 ZP. This will be "
"an extra option in every shop, in addition to his 10 ZP item. He may sell "
"cheap weapons and battle rodents!"
msgstr ""
"상인 노움이 20 ZP 상품을 취급하도록 강화된다. 모든 상점에서 10 ZP 상품 외에 새 상품을 고를 수 있다. 값싼 무기와 전투용 "
"설치류를 팔기도 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "ULTIMATE TRADE GNOME DELUXE ULTRA"
msgstr "궁극의 상인 노움 디럭스 울트라"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Tnomey has reached his ultimate form!"
msgstr "트노미가 궁극의 형태에 도달했다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"SOMEONE'S A BIG SPENDER\r\n"
"\tWITH A NOSE FOR GNOMISH DEALS\r\n"
"\tIT'S YOUUUUU"
msgstr ""
"통 크게 쓰는 손님이네!!\r\n"
"\t노움의 알뜰 상품을 알아보는 코!!\r\n"
"\t바로 너어어어!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"This will upgrade the Trade Gnome to also carry items worth 30 ZP. He may "
"sell some new weapons and random rare characters!"
msgstr "상인 노움이 30 ZP 상품도 취급하도록 강화된다. 새로운 무기나 무작위 희귀 캐릭터를 팔기도 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "HERO OF THE ZOMBOCALYPSE"
msgstr "좀비 종말의 영웅"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "You now get 1 ZP for every successful rescue!"
msgstr "이제 구조에 성공할 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"WHEN YOU RESCUE SOMEONE\r\n"
"\tYOU SHOULD PROBABLY SHAKE THEM DOWN\r\n"
"\tFOR THEIR SWEET ZOMBO POINTS"
msgstr ""
"누굴 구해 주면!!\r\n"
"\t좀 뜯어내는 게 좋겠지!!\r\n"
"\t그 달콤한 좀보 포인트 말이야!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Get 1 ZP every time you rescue a person or dog!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"사람이나 개를 구할 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid " For normal rescues only, rare rescues don't count."
msgstr " 일반 구조만 해당한다. 희귀 구조는 제외된다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "BUYER REWARDS PROGRAM"
msgstr "구매 보상 프로그램"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "You now get 1 ZP for each sale to the weapons buyers!"
msgstr "이제 무기 매입상에게 팔 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I HAVE A SPECIAL DEAL WITH THE WEAPON BUYERS\r\n"
"\tSO THEY AND TNOMEY CAN BOTH RIP YOU OFF BETTER\r\n"
"\tIT IS WHAT GNOMES CALL A WIN-WIN"
msgstr ""
"무기 매입상과 특별 계약을 했어!!\r\n"
"\t놈들과 트노미가 네 등골을 더 잘 빼먹도록!!\r\n"
"\t노움은 이걸 윈윈이라고 하지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:272
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Get 1 ZP every time you sell an item to the weapons buyers!"
msgstr "무기 매입상에게 물건을 팔 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "MAKING NEW FRIENDS"
msgstr "새 친구 사귀기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "You now get 1 ZP for each time you get a new recruit!"
msgstr "이제 새 동료를 영입할 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"ZOMBO POINTS FLOW THROUGH ALL LIFE\r\n"
"\tTHEY ARE EXACTLY LIKE MIDI-CHLORIANS\r\n"
"\tGNOMES LOVE THE STAR WARS PREQUELS"
msgstr ""
"좀보 포인트는 모든 생명 속에 흐르지!!\r\n"
"\t미디클로리언이랑 똑같아!!\r\n"
"\t노움은 스타워즈 프리퀄을 좋아해!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Get 1 ZP every time you recruit someone or something!"
msgstr "누군가, 또는 무언가를 영입할 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "MAKING NEW SKELETONS"
msgstr "새 해골 만들기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "You now get 1 ZP for each time an ally dies!"
msgstr "이제 동료가 죽을 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "THE ULTIMATE ZP GENERATOR"
msgstr "궁극의 ZP 생성기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I COULD START GIVING YOU A ZOMBO POINT\r\n"
"\tWHENEVER SOMEONE ON YOUR TEAM GETS KILLED\r\n"
"\tTHIS SEEMS LIKE A PRETTY GOOD IDEA"
msgstr ""
"좀보 포인트를 하나씩 줄 수도 있지!!\r\n"
"\t네 일행 누가 죽을 때마다!!\r\n"
"\t꽤 좋은 생각 같은데!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:297
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Get 1 ZP every time an ally dies!"
msgstr "동료가 죽을 때마다 1 ZP를 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "WEIRDER TRADERS"
msgstr "더 이상한 상인들"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Rare Trader chance increased!\r\n"
"\tThe chance has gone from 1/30 to 1/27!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 상인 등장 확률 증가!\r\n"
"\t1/30에서 1/27로 높아졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:307
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"IN TRADER CAMPS\r\n"
"\tSOMETIMES A REAL WEIRDO CAN SHOW UP\r\n"
"\tRARE TRADERS HAVE RARE DEALS"
msgstr ""
"상인 야영지에는!!\r\n"
"\t가끔 정말 괴상한 놈이 나타나!!\r\n"
"\t희귀 상인은 희귀 상품을 팔지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Normal chance of a Rare Trader is 1/30\r\n"
"\tThis will increase the chance to 1/27!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 상인의 기본 등장 확률은 1/30이다.\r\n"
"\t이 강화로 확률이 1/27이 된다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "EVEN WEIRDER TRADERS"
msgstr "한층 더 이상한 상인들"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Rare Trader chance increased!\r\n"
"\tThe chance has gone from 1/27 to 1/24!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 상인 등장 확률 증가!\r\n"
"\t1/27에서 1/24로 높아졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"THERE ARE MANY RARE TRADERS\r\n"
"\tI HAVE SEEN A WITCH ONCE ALSO A WIZARD\r\n"
"\tSOME CAN BE RECRUITED FOR A BRIBE"
msgstr ""
"희귀 상인은 아주 다양해!!\r\n"
"\t마녀도 한 번 봤고 마법사도 봤어!!\r\n"
"\t뇌물을 주면 영입할 수 있는 놈도 있지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Rare Traders chance will increase to 1/24!"
msgstr "희귀 상인 등장 확률이 1/24로 높아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "MORE WEIRDERER TRADERS"
msgstr "더더더 이상한 상인들"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:331
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Rare Trader chance increased!\r\n"
"\tThe chance has gone from 1/24 to 1/21!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 상인 등장 확률 증가!\r\n"
"\t1/24에서 1/21로 높아졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I'M PASSING OUT LOTS OF FLYERS\r\n"
"\tI DREW THEM WITH COLORED PENCILS\r\n"
"\tTHIS WILL BRING THE BEST TRADERS IN"
msgstr ""
"전단지를 잔뜩 돌리고 있어!!\r\n"
"\t색연필로 그렸지!!\r\n"
"\t최고의 상인들이 몰려올 거야!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Rare Traders chance will increase to 1/21!"
msgstr "희귀 상인 등장 확률이 1/21로 높아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "MOST WEIRDEST TRADERS"
msgstr "제일 이상한 상인들"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Rare Trader chance increased!\r\n"
"\tThe chance has gone from 1/21 to 1/18!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 상인 등장 확률 증가!\r\n"
"\t1/21에서 1/18로 높아졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"You now have a higher chance of finding more than one Rare Trader per game!"
msgstr "한 게임에서 희귀 상인을 여러 명 만날 확률도 높아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:348
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I CAN HIRE A GNOMISH SIGN SPINNER\r\n"
"\tLOTS MORE WEIRD TRADERS WILL SHOW UP\r\n"
"\tIT HEIGHTENS THE SHOPPING EXPERIENCE!"
msgstr ""
"간판 돌리는 노움을 고용하면!!\r\n"
"\t이상한 상인이 훨씬 많이 올 거야!!\r\n"
"\t쇼핑의 품격이 올라가지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:351
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Rare Traders chance will increase to 1/18!"
msgstr "희귀 상인 등장 확률이 1/18로 높아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:357
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "EXOTIC LOCALES"
msgstr "이국적인 장소"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:358
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Locations has increased from roughly 3/55 to 4/55!\r\n"
"\tYou may also now find up to 4 Rare Locations in one game, up from 3!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 장소 등장 확률이 약 3/55에서 4/55로 높아졌다!\r\n"
"\t한 게임에서 찾을 수 있는 희귀 장소 수도 3곳에서 4곳으로 늘었다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:361
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I'M SELLING THESE SPECIAL MAPS\r\n"
"\tI DREW THEM WITH COLORED PENCILS"
msgstr ""
"특별 지도를 팔고 있어!!\r\n"
"\t색연필로 그렸지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Locations will slightly increase! You may also find one extra Rare Location in a game!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"희귀 장소 등장 확률이 조금 높아진다! 한 게임에서 찾을 수 있는 희귀 장소도 한 곳 늘어난다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid " Rare Locations can be identified by their flashing text."
msgstr " 희귀 장소는 깜빡이는 글자로 구별할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "STRANGE DAYS ON THE DEATH ROAD"
msgstr "데스 로드의 이상한 나날"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Events has increased from roughly 2/55 to 3/55!\r\n"
"\tYou may also now find up to 3 Rare Events in one game, up from 2!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 이벤트 등장 확률이 약 2/55에서 3/55로 높아졌다!\r\n"
"\t한 게임에서 만날 수 있는 희귀 이벤트 수도 2개에서 3개로 늘었다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"ALL SORTS OF NONSENSE CAN HAPPEN ON THE ROAD\r\n"
"\tYOU SHOULD JUST ROLL WITH IT"
msgstr ""
"길에서는 온갖 황당한 일이 생겨!!\r\n"
"\t그냥 흐름에 맡기는 게 좋아!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Road Events will slightly increase!\r\n"
"\tYou may also find an extra Rare Event in a game!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 도로 이벤트 등장 확률이 조금 높아진다!\r\n"
"\t한 게임에서 만날 수 있는 희귀 이벤트도 하나 늘어난다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION"
msgstr "입지, 입지, 입지"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Locations has increased from roughly 4/55 to 5/55!\r\n"
"\tYou may also now find up to 5 Rare Locations in one game, up from 4!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 장소 등장 확률이 약 4/55에서 5/55로 높아졌다!\r\n"
"\t한 게임에서 찾을 수 있는 희귀 장소 수도 4곳에서 5곳으로 늘었다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I'M SELLING DELUXE TOUR GUIDES NOW\r\n"
"\tTHEY'RE THE OLD ONES\r\n"
"\tBUT I PUT STICKERS ON THEM"
msgstr ""
"이제 고급 관광 안내서를 팔아!!\r\n"
"\t예전에 팔던 거지만!!\r\n"
"\t스티커를 붙였지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:390
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Locations will slightly increase! You may also find one extra"
" Rare Location in a game!"
msgstr "희귀 장소 등장 확률이 조금 높아진다! 한 게임에서 찾을 수 있는 희귀 장소도 한 곳 늘어난다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "A VERY WEIRD JOURNEY"
msgstr "아주 이상한 여행"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Events has increased from roughly 3/55 to 4/55!\r\n"
"\tYou may also now find up to 4 Rare Events in one game, up from 3!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 이벤트 등장 확률이 약 3/55에서 4/55로 높아졌다!\r\n"
"\t한 게임에서 만날 수 있는 희귀 이벤트 수도 3개에서 4개로 늘었다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:400
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"WEIRD AND WONDROUS EVENTS CAN HAPPEN\r\n"
"\tIF YOU BELIEVE IN THE POWER OF FRIENDSHIP"
msgstr ""
"이상하고 신기한 일이 생길 수 있지!!\r\n"
"\t우정의 힘을 믿는다면!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Chance of Rare Road Events will increase further!\r\n"
"\tYou may also find another extra Rare Event in a game!"
msgstr ""
"희귀 도로 이벤트 등장 확률이 더 높아진다!\r\n"
"\t한 게임에서 만날 수 있는 희귀 이벤트도 하나 더 늘어난다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:409
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "A CHALLENGING HUT"
msgstr "도전적인 오두막"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:410
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"You've unlocked a new building, where you can see new challenges and unlock "
"cosmetic features!"
msgstr "새 건물이 해금됐다! 새로운 도전을 확인하고 꾸미기 요소를 해금할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"A MAGICAL HUT OF CHALLENGES\r\n"
"\tALSO CONTAINS A *VERY* SPECIAL STORE"
msgstr ""
"마법의 도전 오두막!!\r\n"
"\t*아주* 특별한 상점도 있지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocks a new building where you can view special challenges!\r\n"
"\tBeating these challenges can unlock new cosmetic features!"
msgstr ""
"특별한 도전을 확인할 수 있는 새 건물이 해금된다!\r\n"
"\t도전을 완료하면 새로운 꾸미기 요소를 해금할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:422
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "You can now buy from Tnomey twice per game!"
msgstr "이제 한 게임에서 트노미에게 두 번 구매할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:424
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"IF YOU LOVE TNOMEY SO MUCH\r\n"
"\tWHY DON'T YOU GET\r\n"
"\tDOUBLE THE TNOMEYS??"
msgstr ""
"트노미가 그렇게 좋으면!!\r\n"
"\t한번 만나 보는 게 어때!!\r\n"
"\t두 배의 트노미를??"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:427
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Buy from Tnomey the Trade Gnome up to twice per game, instead of just once!"
msgstr "상인 노움 트노미에게 한 게임에 한 번 대신 두 번까지 구매할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:434
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "You can buy from Tnomey up to three times per game!"
msgstr "트노미에게 한 게임에 세 번까지 구매할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:436
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"TRIPLE THE VALUES\r\n"
"\tTRIPLE THE WHOLESOME WHIMSY\r\n"
"\tTRIPLE THE TNOMEYS"
msgstr ""
"가치도 세 배!!\r\n"
"\t훈훈한 장난기도 세 배!!\r\n"
"\t트노미도 세 배!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"Buy from Tnomey the Trade Gnome up to three times per game! Burn that ZP!"
msgstr "상인 노움 트노미에게 한 게임에 세 번까지 구매할 수 있다! ZP를 불태우자!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:444
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "UNOMEY THE UNLOCK GNOME"
msgstr "해금 노움 우노미"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:448
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I'M UNOMEY, THE UNLOCK GNOME\r\n"
"\t\tYOU FOUND ME!\r\n"
"\t\tI'LL SELL YOU UNLOCKS FROM NOW ON\r\n"
"\t\tGET OUT OF MY HOUSE YOU NERD!"
msgstr ""
"난 해금 노움 우노미야!!\r\n"
"\t\t날 찾았네!!\r\n"
"\t\t이제 해금 상품을 팔아 줄게!!\r\n"
"\t\t내 집에서 나가, 이 찌질아!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:454
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"HELLO I'M UNOMEY\r\n"
"\t\tDON'T YOU KNOW ME?"
msgstr ""
"안녕, 난 우노미야!!\r\n"
"\t\t우노미를 몰라?"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:458
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"UNLOCKS ARE A BIG PART\r\n"
"\t\t\tOF GNOME SOCIETY!\r\n"
"\t\t\tWHOEVER HAS THE MOST UNLOCKS IS KING"
msgstr ""
"해금은 아주 중요한 부분이지!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t노움 사회에서 말이야!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t가장 많이 해금한 자가 왕이야!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:464
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"GNOMES INVENTED UNLOCKS!\r\n"
"\t\t\tWE CALL THEM 'UNCKS' FOR SHORT\r\n"
"\t\t\tIT SAVES A LOT OF TIME TO CALL THEM THIS"
msgstr ""
"해금은 노움이 발명했어!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t줄여서 '해꾸'라고 하지!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t이렇게 부르면 시간이 엄청 절약돼!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:470
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"MORE UNLOCKS\r\n"
"\t\t\tMORE PROBLEMS\r\n"
"\t\t\t-- GNOMISH PROVERB"
msgstr ""
"해금이 많아질수록!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t문제도 많아진다!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t-- 노움 속담"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"NO ONE CAN GET ENOUGH\r\n"
"\t\t\tOF THESE UNCKS\r\n"
"\t\t\t'UNCKS' MEANS UNLOCKS"
msgstr ""
"누구도 충분히 가질 수 없어!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t이 해꾸는 말이야!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t'해꾸'는 해금이란 뜻이야!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:482
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I HOPE YOU ENJOYED THESE UNCKS\r\n"
"\t\t\tAS MUCH AS I ENJOYED STANDING HERE\r\n"
"\t\t\tFOR DAYS"
msgstr ""
"해꾸를 즐겼길 바라!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t내가 여기 서 있었던 만큼!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t며칠씩이나!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:488
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I'M RUNNING OUT OF STUFF FOR NOW!\r\n"
"\t\t\tI WILL HAVE A LOT MORE THINGS LATER\r\n"
"\t\t\tMAYBE EVEN ANOTHER TOILET FOR YOU"
msgstr ""
"지금은 팔 게 거의 다 떨어졌어!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t나중에는 더 많이 가져올게!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t어쩌면 변기도 또 가져올지 몰라!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:494
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid ""
"I'M OUT OF UNLOCKS!\r\n"
"\t\t\tCHECK BACK NEXT UPDATE\r\n"
"\t\t\tI'LL HAVE MORE, MAYBE!"
msgstr ""
"해금 상품이 다 떨어졌어!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t다음 업데이트 때 와!!\r\n"
"\t\t\t더 있을지도 모르지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/gnome.df"
msgid "Leave this thing be"
msgstr "이 녀석은 내버려 두기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "  UPGRADES LEFT: "
msgstr "  남은 강화: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid " UNLOCKS: "
msgstr " 해금: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "THE CAR IS A SYMBOL OF HOPE"
msgstr "차는 희망의 상징이다!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "CAN'T DIE WITH ALL THIS GAUZE"
msgstr "붕대가 이렇게 많은데 죽을 순 없지!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "PRECIOUS PUPS"
msgstr "소중한 강아지들!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "License Plate: SWEETRIDEZ"
msgstr "번호판: 멋진차들"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "NO STONE UNTURNED, NO TOILET UNOPENED"
msgstr "돌은 다 들춰 보고, 변기는 다 열어 보고!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "UGH MY FEET HURT"
msgstr "으악, 발 아파!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "SALES LEADER IN THE ZOMBOCALYPSE"
msgstr "좀비 종말의 판매왕!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "POWER OF POSITIVE THINKING"
msgstr "긍정적 사고의 힘!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "HELPY HELPERSON"
msgstr "도움 주는 도우미!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "Perks of the Mind"
msgstr "정신의 특전"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"The Debutante is holding a tiny teacup.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"사교계 아가씨가 작은 찻잔을 들고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"Running around, flailing, just has no GRACE to it! You should use "
"INTELLIGENCE and DECORUM."
msgstr "이리저리 뛰고 허우적거리다니, 우아함이 전혀 없잖아! 지성과 예의를 갖춰야지."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tShe crushes the teacup into a fine dust."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t그녀가 찻잔을 곱게 가루로 부순다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"I'm all out of teacups now!\r\n"
"\t\tWell, I can get more later."
msgstr ""
"찻잔이 다 떨어졌네!\r\n"
"\t\t뭐, 나중에 더 구하면 되지."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe shrugs in an elegant manner."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀가 우아하게 어깨를 으쓱한다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"I think Explorer is underrated.\r\n"
"\t\tYou can use its cheaper 'drive around' option to seek out the best locations, so you can keep well stocked with supplies!"
msgstr ""
"탐험가는 저평가된 것 같아.\r\n"
"\t\t저렴한 '주변 둘러보기'로 좋은 장소를 찾으면 물자를 넉넉히 챙길 수 있지!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"One of my favorite strategies is focusing on mechanical and medical skills, "
"and then filling my group with useful meat shields!"
msgstr "내가 좋아하는 전략은 기계와 의술을 키운 다음, 쓸 만한 고기 방패로 일행을 채우는 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:159
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"Keep calm and alert!\r\n"
"\t\tKeep your car running and your meat shields healed!"
msgstr ""
"침착하게 경계를 늦추지 마!\r\n"
"\t\t차는 잘 굴러가게, 고기 방패는 건강하게 유지하고!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"I have nothing left to teach you!\r\n"
"\t\tKeep thinking things through, and you'll make it!"
msgstr ""
"더 가르쳐 줄 게 없네!\r\n"
"\t\t계속 머리를 쓰면 해낼 수 있을 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe crushes a handful of fine dust, and when she opens her hands it has turned into a teacup."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀가 고운 가루 한 줌을 움켜쥔다. 손을 펴자 찻잔으로 변해 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk1.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid "  UPGRADES LEFT: "
msgstr "  남은 강화: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid " UNLOCKS: "
msgstr " 해금: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid "WARMED UP"
msgstr "몸풀기 완료!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid "TOO FIT TO QUIT"
msgstr "멈추기엔 너무 튼튼해!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid "FLEX"
msgstr "근육 자랑!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid "HIT LIKE A TRUCK"
msgstr "트럭처럼 후려친다!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid "WEAPONS NOT NEEDED"
msgstr "무기는 필요 없다!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df"
msgid "UNLEASHED POTENTIAL"
msgstr "잠재력 해방!!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/perk2.df:94
